dataset(wages).glm(union ~ educ + exper, family: binomial, se: hc2, cluster: worker)
---
error[Z0410]: `se: hc2` and `cluster:` exclude each other
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:64
  |
1 | dataset(wages).glm(union ~ educ + exper, family: binomial, se: hc2, cluster: worker)
  |                                                                ^^^ two kinds of standard error
  |
  = help: clustered errors are CR1; leave `se:` out with `cluster:`

